OL,3,A'Sexually obsessed' stepdad jailed for
OL,4,Amurdering student
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains distressing
OL,7,Fdetails.
OL,9,FA man who was "sexually obsessed" with
OL,10,Fhis stepdaughter has been jailed for a
OL,11,Fminimum of 35 years for murdering her
OL,12,Fat her university flat on her 20th
OL,13,Fbirthday.
OL,15,FNathan Owens, 34, from Hartlepool,
OL,16,Fkilled Carla Georgescu in her room at
OL,17,Fthe University of Lancashire property
OL,18,Fin Preston in February and then staged
OL,19,Fthe scene to make it look like she had
OL,20,Ftaken her own life.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
